   "width": 555.06,
   "height": 41.25,
   "text": "2LDs trade as plain ERC-721. Subnames are created via controller.createSubname and\nare ALWAYS owned by the 2LD owner (hard-wired; foreign-owned subnames via direct\nregistry calls stay unindexed + untrusted). Subgraph: optional (history only), per #20.",
